{"id": 19954, "title": "Who I am", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK1"], "slug": "who-i-am", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/19954_who-i-am.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我的名字叫李大卫， 我是美国人， 但是在日本长大， 在英国上大学， 现在在中国工作。 我在大学学习历史和英语， 现在是一个英语老师， 我非常喜欢我的工作。 学生们很好， 学校也很好。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我的名字叫李大衛， 我是美國人， 但是在日本長大， 在英國上大學， 現在在中國工作。 我在大學學習歷史和英語， 現在是一個英語老師， 我非常喜歡我的工作。 學生們很好， 學校也很好。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ de míng zi jiào Lǐ Dà wèi，  wǒ shì Měi guó rén，  dàn shì zài Rì běn zhǎng dà，  zài Yīng guó shàng dà xué，  xiàn zài zài Zhōng guó gōng zuò。  wǒ zài dà xué xué xí lì shǐ hé Yīng yǔ，  xiàn zài shì yī gè Yīng yǔ lǎo shī，  wǒ fēi cháng xǐ huan wǒ de gōng zuò。  xué shēng men hěn hǎo，  xué xiào yě hěn hǎo。"], "english_paragraphs": ["My name is David Lee. I'm American, but I grew up in Japan, went to college in England, and now work in China. I studied history and English at university and am now an English teacher. I really enjoy my job. The students are great and the school is great."], "english_full": "My name is David Lee. I'm American, but I grew up in Japan, went to college in England, and now work in China. I studied history and English at university and am now an English teacher. I really enjoy my job. The students are great and the school is great.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ de\" data-defn=\"my; mine\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"míng zi\" data-defn=\"name (of a person or thing)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">名字</span><span class=\"tr\">名字</span><rt>míng zi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiào\" data-defn=\"to be called\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">叫</span><span class=\"tr\">叫</span><rt>jiào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Lǐ Dà wèi\" data-defn=\"David Lee; a Chinese transliteration/name used as a personal name.\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">李大卫</span><span class